          "Differentiate $\\ln x$ to obtain $\\frac{1}{x}$.",
          "Differentiate $\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(x^2+4)$ to obtain $\\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{2x}{x^2+4} = \\frac{x}{x^2+4}$.",
          "Add the resulting terms."
        ],
        "common_pitfalls": "Forgetting the factor of $\\frac{1}{2}$ from the square root power."
      }
    },
    {
